     1485   PROCEDURE change-view :
     1486   define input parameter p-view as character no-undo.
     1487   display
     1488   rs-view
     1489   with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1490   assign
     1491   tt-c-fin-doc.exch-rate frame Dialog-Frame
     1492   tt-c-fin-doc.exch-scale
     1493   tt-c-fin-doc.sum-doc
     1494   .
     1495   hide
     1496   f-debet
     1497   f-credit
     1498   tt-c-fin-doc.cor-acc1-value
     1499   f-cor-acc1-descr
     1500   tt-c-fin-doc.cor-acc-value
     1501   f-cor-acc-descr
     1502   tt-c-fin-doc.an-uchet-value
     1503   f-an-uchet-descr
     1504   tt-c-fin-doc.cel-nazn-value
     1505   f-cel-nazn-descr
