     1569   b-receiver-view
     1570   b-payer-view
     1571   WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1572   assign
     1573   b-quit:label = "&Выход".
     1574   run hide-view-currency in this-procedure.
     1575   CASE p-view:
     1576     when "full":U then do:
     1577       IF AVAILABLE tt-c-fin-doc THEN
     1578       display
     1579       tt-c-fin-doc.receiver-type
     1580       tt-c-fin-doc.receiver-code
     1581       tt-c-fin-doc.receiver-okpo
